{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:f585506feb7c530a","name":"Heavy Blaster Cannon","source":{"id":"source:reference-f585506feb7c530a","title":"Heavy Blaster Cannon","revision":20189,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T23:22:46Z","sha256":"d08788a33d6f8c810dbe1829d2059c2856fe13fd2e6decc3a51720f256fcbdf6","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20189","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Heavy%20Blaster%20Cannon&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-f585506feb7c530a","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Legacy Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A Heavy Blaster Cannon, such as the Merr-Sonn BB-23 Heavy Blaster Cannon used by ",{"tag":"a","children":["Joker Squad Heavy Weapons Specialists"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Joker_Squad_Heavy_Weapons_Specialists"},", is a devastating weapon that can wreak havoc on enemies that stay too close to one another. Specifically designed for use against infantry and other ground-based personnel, the Heavy Blaster Cannon is considerably larger than most weapons intended for use by an individual soldier. \n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["However, a Heavy Blaster Cannon can be ",{"tag":"a","children":["Braced"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Braced"}," by spending two ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Actions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Actions"}," in the same round immediately before making an attack; if the weapon is ",{"tag":"a","children":["Braced"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Braced"},", it is treated as a Large weapon, and can be fired by a Medium character. If the weapon is not ",{"tag":"a","children":["Braced"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Braced"},", it cannot be fired by any creature of Medium size or smaller. \n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A Heavy Blaster Cannon is an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Area Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Area_Attack"}," weapon. It deals full damage to the target if the attack hits its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," (half damage if it has the ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Evasion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Evasion"}]}," Talent) and half damage if it misses (no damage if it has the ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Evasion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Evasion"}]}," Talent). Any creature or object in the 1-Square ",{"tag":"a","children":["Splash"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Splash"}," radius of the target takes half damage if the attack hits (no damage if it has the ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Evasion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Evasion"}]}," Talent) and no damage if it misses.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A Heavy Blaster Cannon requires a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Power Pack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Power_Pack","referenceId":"reference:2b783ab0537ca5d0"}," to operate. After 10 shots, the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Power Pack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Power_Pack","referenceId":"reference:2b783ab0537ca5d0"}," must be replaced.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weapon Type:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Heavy Weapons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Heavy_Weapons","referenceId":"reference:a2b1d4c4bac82300"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Size:"]}," Huge\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 4,200\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Damage:"]}," 4d12\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Stun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun"}," Setting:"]}," NO\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Rate of Fire:"]}," Single-Shot\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 22 Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Type:"]}," Energy\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Military"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Military"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Inaccurate:"]}," This weapon cannot fire at targets at Long ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Special:"]}," This is an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Area Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Area_Attack"}," weapon.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
